# Local Vite dev — DO NOT set VITE_API_BASE here.
# Leaving it unset makes the app call the same-origin Vite proxy (5173/api → :5000,
# see vite.config.js). Same-origin is REQUIRED so Flask's session cookie (SameSite=Lax)
# is sent on every request — otherwise the cart_id is lost and the cart always reads empty.
# Setting it to http://127.0.0.1:5000 forces cross-origin calls and breaks the cart/session.
# YOLO /detect still reaches Flask :5000 through the proxy.
# VITE_API_BASE=http://127.0.0.1:5000
